{"id": "t081-056", "text": "Jonah's parents divorcing after 30 yrs. he only found out Sun when his dad rang. his mum's moving to her sister's in Cork sometime soon. Jonah's not ok, signed off work for a wk. said he might fly over to see her end of Nov. need to call him Weds eve, around 8", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jonah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "divorcing", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after 30 yrs"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sun"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving", "owner": "r3", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "r3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime soon", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jonah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not ok", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "signed off work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "a wk", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fly over", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of Nov", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "Weds eve, around 8", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t081-058", "text": "long chat w/ Marcus last night. his mum selling the family house sometime in the spring - too many memories. he's helping her sort it. Marcus thinking of a trip to Japan after, solo, to clear his head. said he's doing a bit better. remind me to send him that Kyoto list", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "selling the family house", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trip to Japan", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing a bit better", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him that Kyoto list", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t081-060", "text": "Christmas plans - at mum's 24th-27th, then Edinburgh for NY. book train soon", "spans": [{"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "24th-27th"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Edinburgh", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "NY", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book train", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "soon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
